# Minimal fixture Weave config for the layer-5 agent-materialization smoke.
#
# The V2 adapter loads this via `@weaveio/weave-config`'s `loadConfig()` when
# `setup(ctx)` runs. An empty config is enough: `loadConfig` merges the built-in
# agents (Loom, Shuttle, Weft, Warp, ...) from `@weaveio/weave-config`'s
# `builtins.ts`, so the resulting materialization plan produces at least a
# `loom` descriptor. The smoke test asserts `host.agent.list()` contains a
# `loom` entry whose description starts with the V2-package-local ownership
# marker.
#
# Loom is `mode primary` with `models ["claude-sonnet-4-5"]`. The embedded
# container catalog does not carry that model — but `resolveModelContext`
# only fail-fast rejects subagents (see model-resolution.ts). Primary agents
# fall back to the harness `systemDefault`, so materialization still succeeds
# in the container.
